# The second launch on the same folder: federation and balance are back, and the
# prompt for the words stays gone. A launch during `shot reopened` must fail.
expect-slow Devimint Federation
expect-slow 0.0019 BTC
expect +0.0019
expect-not Join a federation
expect-not Write down your recovery words
shot reopened
# Settings offers only what the real backend has.
action app.settings
expect Recovery words
expect-not Anonymity target
expect-not Budget (sat per month)
expect-not Hardware wallet
shot settings
scroll-end
shot settings-end
# Without Saving the balance stands alone: a target would imply money on its way.
type "Target (BTC)" 0.001
wait 800
click Back
expect-not waiting for Saving
expect-not moving to Saving
expect-not Set up Saving
shot waiting-for-saving
